## Scenario 1: Basic Reservation & Expiration
**URL:** http://localhost:3000/product/test-item-1

### Pre-check:
✔ [ ] Stock shows 10 units @done(26-04-07 11:33)
✔ [ ] Reserved shows 0 units @done(26-04-07 11:33)
✔ [ ] Can add items to basket @done(26-04-07 11:33)

### Steps:
✔ [ ] Add 2x "Test Product 1" to basket @done(26-04-07 11:33)
✔ [ ] Navigate to basket @done(26-04-07 11:34)
- [ ] Click Checkout button
- [ ] Wait 15 seconds (reservation expiration)
- [ ] Refresh basket page
- [ ] Verify: Stock shows 10, Reserved shows 0
- [ ] Verify: Can add the same items again

### Expected Results:
- Stock decreases from 10 to 8 when reserving
- Reserved increases from 0 to 2 when reserving
- Stock returns to 10 after 15 seconds
- Reserved returns to 0 after 15 seconds
- Items can be re-added after expiration

---

## Scenario 2: Back Button Abandonment
**URL:** http://localhost:3000/product/test-item-1

### Pre-check:
- [ ] Stock shows 10 units
- [ ] Reserved shows 0 units

### Steps:
- [ ] Add 2x "Test Product 1" to basket
- [ ] Navigate to basket
- [ ] Click Checkout button
- [ ] Verify: Stock shows 8, Reserved shows 2
- [ ] Click browser back button
- [ ] Verify: Stock still shows 8, Reserved still shows 2
- [ ] Navigate back to basket
- [ ] Click Checkout again
- [ ] Verify: No additional reservation (still 2 reserved)
- [ ] Wait 15 seconds
- [ ] Verify: Stock returns to 10, Reserved returns to 0

### Expected Results:
- Reservation persists when going back
- No double reservation on retry
- Stock properly released after expiration

---

## Scenario 3: Tab Close & Reopen
**URL:** http://localhost:3000/product/test-item-1

### Pre-check:
- [ ] Stock shows 10 units
- [ ] Reserved shows 0 units

### Steps:
- [ ] Add 2x "Test Product 1" to basket
- [ ] Navigate to basket
- [ ] Click Checkout button
- [ ] Verify: Stock shows 8, Reserved shows 2
- [ ] Close the browser tab
- [ ] Open new tab
- [ ] Navigate to: http://localhost:3000/basket
- [ ] Verify: Items still in basket
- [ ] Verify: Stock still shows 8, Reserved still shows 2
- [ ] Wait 15 seconds
- [ ] Verify: Stock returns to 10, Reserved returns to 0

### Expected Results:
- Basket persists across tab sessions
- Reservation persists across tab sessions
- Stock properly released after expiration

