## Scenario 4: Multiple Rapid Checkouts
**URL:** http://localhost:3000/product/test-item-1

### Pre-check:
- [ ] Stock shows 10 units
- [ ] Reserved shows 0 units

### Steps:
- [ ] Add 2x "Test Product 1" to basket
- [ ] Navigate to basket
- [ ] Click Checkout button
- [ ] Verify: Stock shows 8, Reserved shows 2
- [ ] Rapidly click Checkout 3 more times (within 2 seconds)
- [ ] Verify: Stock still shows 8, Reserved still shows 2
- [ ] Wait 15 seconds
- [ ] Verify: Stock returns to 10, Reserved returns to 0

### Expected Results:
- No double reservations on rapid clicks
- Single reservation maintained
- Stock properly released after expiration

