## Scenario 5: Multiple Products
**URL:** http://localhost:3000/product/test-item-1

### Pre-check:
- [ ] Both products show 10 stock
- [ ] Both show 0 reserved

### Steps:
- [ ] Add 2x "Test Product 1" to basket
- [ ] Navigate to: http://localhost:3000/product/test-item-2
- [ ] Add 1x "Test Product 2" to basket
- [ ] Navigate to basket
- [ ] Verify: Both items in basket
- [ ] Click Checkout button
- [ ] Verify:
  - Test Product 1: Stock 8, Reserved 2
  - Test Product 2: Stock 9, Reserved 1
- [ ] Wait 15 seconds
- [ ] Verify:
  - Test Product 1: Stock 10, Reserved 0
  - Test Product 2: Stock 10, Reserved 0

### Expected Results:
- Independent reservations for different products
- Proper stock tracking for each product
- All reservations released after expiration

