## Scenario 6: Background Job Cleanup
**URL:** http://localhost:3000/product/test-item-1

### Pre-check:
- [ ] Stock shows 10 units
- [ ] Reserved shows 0 units

### Steps:
- [ ] Add 2x "Test Product 1" to basket
- [ ] Navigate to basket
- [ ] Click Checkout button
- [ ] Verify: Stock shows 8, Reserved shows 2
- [ ] Run background job manually:
  ```bash
  node scripts/clean-expired-reservations.mjs
  ```
- [ ] Verify: Stock shows 10, Reserved shows 0

### Expected Results:
- Background job cleans expired reservations
- Stock released immediately when job runs
- No manual waiting required

