## Helper Commands (Use anytime)

### Check current reservation status:
```bash
node tests/manual/check-reservations.js
```

### Reset test products:
```bash
node tests/manual/cleanup-test-products.js
node tests/manual/setup-test-products.js
```

### Browser Helper (Optional):
- Copy contents of `tests/manual/browser-helper.js`
- Paste in browser console
- Shows live status in top-right corner

